  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Nice Dream</h4><p class="sqsrte-small" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">56778 29 Palms Highway Yucca Valley, CA 92284</p><p class="sqsrte-small" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Thursday 8am-9pm </p><p class="sqsrte-small" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Friday &amp; Saturday 8am-9pm </p><p class="sqsrte-small" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Sunday 8am-4pm </p><p class="sqsrte-small" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Mon-Wed CLOSED</p><p class="sqsrte-small" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><em>Coffee &amp; tea, pastries, and ice cream are served all day. Lunch service runs 11am - 3pm; dinner service runs 5:30 - 9pm (last seating 8pm). Reservations for dinner are not required, but strongly encouraged. </em><a href="sushi-reservations.html"><strong><em>Book here</em></strong></a><em>.</em></p><p class="sqsrte-small" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-highlight" data-text-attribute-id="ba490d02-302d-4862-b6d8-f91c3f33c5fd"><a target="_blank" href="https://static1.squarespace.com/static/6140f1a0f496ab080247496c/t/6a468cc420e4a8304acd6136/1783008452657/Untitled-22.pdf">Sample Menus</a></span><span class="sqsrte-text-highlight" data-text-attribute-id="db9e9e5d-f5bc-404f-8d45-bffb433b33c3"></span><span class="sqsrte-text-highlight" data-text-attribute-id="e4e96eb3-661d-4332-9dad-2ee6d0b5163a"></span></p></div>


  








